    Requires: []
    Pages:
    - Id: zoo
      ArtKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Events/petting_zoo/zoo.png
      Title: The Petting Zoo
      Body: 'Somewhere between two realities, someone has fenced off a paddock and
        hung a sign: PETTING ZOO. A sheep chews at the rail. A peacock fans its tail
        at nobody in particular. Two fawns nose at an empty trough, and a cooler
        of cold ones sweats by the gate. Prince''s contract says nothing about petting
        zoos. It doesn''t forbid them either.'
