      - Text: Feed the fawns
        Requires: []
        HiddenUntilMet: 0
        Effects: []
        Outcomes:
        - Requires: []
          Effects:
          - Kind: 7
            Amount: 10
            Item: 
            CounterId: 
            CharacterId: 
            CharacterDisplayName: 
            RelicId: 
            RelicDisplayName: 
          Result: The fawns eat out of your hand and trail you all the way to the
